<title>USA: Cistron names Galton interim chairman.</title>
<headline>Cistron names Galton interim chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PINE BROOK, N.J. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cistron Biotechnology Inc said Wednesday its board of directors had elected Bruce Galton acting chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Galton, who has served as president and chief operating officer since 1988, was elected Tuesday following the resignation of longtime chairman Henry Grausz.</p>
<p>Grausz resigned after he and a company in which he had a management role defaulted on a $230,000 loan made by Cistron, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610))</p>
